# Claude Code: ignore everything under .claude/ by default,
# but keep skill source under .claude/skills/ checked into the repo.
# .claude/skills/<name>-workspace/ (eval runs) and .claude/worktrees/
# (transient subagent worktrees) stay local-only.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*-workspace/
